我兄弟向己也。我独有以不合于远近耳！’遂进谓帝曰：‘陛下作诏免臣官，报皇太后令。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":681,"end":895,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-46588bc9fdcd4116f089","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-46588bc9fdcd4116f089","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十年：正始十年（公元 249）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5be1013409cc3f861402","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o066","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-a06b19e7658aef13c99d","layer":"original","quote":"十年正月〖1〗，车驾朝高平陵〖2〗。爽兄弟皆从。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":312,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
